<title>USA: BioTherapeutics sees '97 revs over $2 mln.</title>
<headline>BioTherapeutics sees '97 revs over $2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LARKSPUR, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioTherapeutics Corp said Wednesday it expects 1997 earnings to exceed $2 million.</p>
<p>It also said it had completed the acquisition of International Biosystems Inc for $3.2 million in cash and stock.</p>
</text>
